commit bfa11af0c0ae4bfea51293ce0b4c640b31339aaa
Author: Lance Colton <lance.colton@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 26 10:45:17 2026 -0700

    refactor(glm): update GLM model management and deprecate older versions

    - Replaced hardcoded GLM model list with dynamic retrieval from model_registry.
    - Marked older GLM models (4.5, 4.6, 4.7) as deprecated in model_config.json, directing users to use glm-5.2.
    - Enhanced user preference handling to migrate deprecated model IDs to supported ones.
    - Updated AI model selection logic in user_preferences.py and ai_routes.py to ensure compatibility with new model management.
    - Adjusted front-end model selection to reflect changes in available models.

    These changes improve model management and ensure users are directed towards the latest supported models.

